\item Ingestion rate: $60$ GB/s (threshold $64$ GB/s).
\item Tensor core utilization: $99.2\%$.
\item Minimum Jacobian: $0.005$.
\item Rendering latency: $10.9$ ms (threshold $11$ ms).
\end{itemize}

